Error [jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed]: The lent mutable view `left` cannot be stored in a binding
  --> tests/ui/ownership/edit_disjoint_callback_views_reject_every_retaining_boundary.jet:5:15
    |
  5 |         held: [left, right]
    |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The view is valid only while the current iteration or callback invocation is active
 Fix: Use the view inside that scope, and keep only owned values outside it
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212
